            "review_title": "Review at Nha Hang Am Thuc Que Nha",
            "review_text": "Momo_yeu_sunny\nAdelaide, Australia73 contributions\n1\nGreat place to experience Vietnamese dining\nJul 2018 • Family\nMulti-story restaurant offering an extensive menu of Vietnamese classics. Order too much and drink copious amounts of beer; it's how Vietnamese life is supposed to be.\n\nThe setting is classic with windows open at all times for you the air to flow through and for you to watch the tropical rain come down in the wet season. Food is very good, staff don't speak much english but that shouldn't hold you back as they are willing to work with you and they have an English menu for you to point at.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nWritten July 21, 2018",
