            "review_text": "JimmyDevasia\nHo Chi Minh City, Vietnam223 contributions\n0\nGreat option for Vietnamese food\nNov 2017 • Business\nA hardcore Vietnamese restaurant, 3 levels with hundreds of people sitting around tables and having a good time.\n\nWe went for a farewell lunch of a colleague. 4 of us. Ordered about 7 dishes. Service is a bit slow but genuine.\n\nI'm glad i found a good option to take visting friends from overseas.\nRead more\nWritten December 13, 2017",
